        <div class="ex-en" style="margin-top:12px;">The new policy has left many employees confused. <button class="voice-btn-inline" style="background:none; border:none; padding:0 4px; font-size:16px; cursor:pointer; opacity:0.5; transition: opacity 0.2s; outline: none; margin-left:4px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; position:static;" onmouseover="this.style.opacity=1" onmouseout="this.style.opacity=0.5" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); speakText('The new policy has left many employees confused.')" title="발음 듣기">🔊</button></div>
